   "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nFixes default new-window placement on small/scaled displays by basing the initial window rectangle on the display *work area* (excluding taskbar/dock) and clamping the default 1440×900 (workspace) / 1200×800 (empty) sizes to the visible region.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Switches default centering from `display.bounds` to `display.workArea`.\n- Clamps default `width/height` to `workArea.width/height` before computing `x/y`.\n- Adds clarifying comments explaining the regression and why clamping is needed.\n\n\n\n",
